WEBVTT

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.809
If we can grab a little piece
of that information,

00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:36.226
it can help to ground us and root us,

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.476
and it can also point us in a direction,

00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:42.476
and typically what it
points us to is our what.

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:43.976
What we manifest in the world,

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.268
what we have.

00:03:45.292 --> 00:03:50.851
So our job, our home,
our hobbies and the like.

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:54.518
But there's this little space
in between the why and the what

00:03:54.542 --> 00:03:57.601
that often doesn't get our full attention,

00:03:57.625 --> 00:03:59.601
and that is our ...

00:03:59.625 --> 00:04:00.893
how.